00:00:00.790 --> 00:00:05.590 align:start position:0%
 
[Applause]  give me one minute and i'll tell you how  cloud data loss prevention can help you  detect and protect sensitive data across  your systems  cloud data loss prevention or cloud dlp  is a fully managed service that lets you  discover classify and protect all kinds  of sensitive data from various sources  cloud dlp can recognize up to 150  different data types like names  addresses dates credit card numbers and  more  you can even define your own custom info  types based on custom dictionary  detectors or regular expressions  every sensitive value that dlp finds is  assigned a certainty score ranging from  very unlikely to very likely giving you  the flexibility to set a confidence  threshold for inspections and  de-identification jobs  speaking of the identification the cloud  dlp api offers a number of  de-identification techniques to obscure  mask tokenize or transform those  sensitive values in your data based on  the info type and the likelihood score  with cloud dlp you can send data  directly into the api or schedule  inspection jobs that will scan the data  that you specify for sensitive values so  you can regularly gain visibility into  the data that you store and process  cloud dlp has built-in support for  scanning and classifying data from cloud  storage and bigquery and has a streaming  content api and hybrid api so that you  can scan other data sources or so you  can use it as part of custom workloads  and applications  the api even leverages optical character  recognition to scan images for sensitive  data allowing you to detect and redact  that data from image files  so next time you're looking to detect  classify and secure your sensitive data  take a minute to look at cloud data loss  prevention to learn more check out  cloud.google.com dlp  [Music]

